whisper: Studio's screens. Build: fathom web screens.fathom ui

use: page
use: web
use: maths
use: letters

a spot has:
  name (text)
  path (text)
  folder (yes or no)
  inside (a list of spots)
and the universe said i love you

a run state has:
  printed (text)
  problems (text)
  running (yes or no)
  code (a number)
and the universe said i love you

a library word has:
  library (text)
  phrase (text)
  given (text)
  gives (text)
and the universe said i love you

a snapshot has:
  changed row (a number)
  old lines (a list of text)
  new lines (a list of text)
  back row (a number)
  back column (a number)
  forth row (a number)
  forth column (a number)
and the universe said i love you

a sheet has:
  path (text)
  body (a list of text)
  caret row (a number)
  caret column (a number)
  anchor row (a number)
  anchor column (a number)
  windows endings (yes or no)
  back (a list of snapshots)
  ahead (a list of snapshots)
  warned (yes or no)
  edit count (a number)
  saved count (a number)
and the universe said i love you

a memory has:
  folder (text)
  files (a list of text)
and the universe said i love you

the world remembers:
  home (text)
  folder (text)
  tree (a list of spots)
  opened (a list of text)
  sheets (a list of sheets)
  current (a number)
  body (a list of text)
  row (a number)
  column (a number)
  mark row (a number)
  mark column (a number)
  goal column (a number)
  back (a list of snapshots)
  ahead (a list of snapshots)
  edits (a number)
  widest (a number)
  typing run (yes or no)
  dragging (yes or no)
  glyph width (a number)
  painted (a table of text)
  classes (a table of text)
  labels (a list of text)
  notes (a list of text)
  picks (a list of numbers)
  suggesting (yes or no)
  chosen (a number)
  prefix size (a number)
  mistake rows (a list of numbers)
  mistake notes (a list of text)
  calm (a number)
  needs look (yes or no)
  looking (yes or no)
  running (yes or no)
  polling (yes or no)
  after build (yes or no)
  halted on purpose (yes or no)
  asking (text)
  code box (a number)
  rows box (a number)
