  output box (a number)
  mistakes box (a number)
  answer box (a number)
  status box (a number)
  where box (a number)
  mistake box (a number)
  stop rows (a list of numbers)
  paused row (a number)
  debugging (yes or no)
  paused (yes or no)
  debug carry (text)
and the universe said i love you

a debug stop has:
  line (a number)
  where (text)
